      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "originalT": 307.6,
      "en": "Craft and Craft. Craft and Crraft。",
      "coverage": 0.5,
      "asrStart": 307.32,
      "asrEnd": 308.46,
      "t": 307.37,
      "source": "interpolated-review",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "originalT": 309.6,
      "en": "Aren't you excited about that?",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 309.58,
      "asrEnd": 311.18,
      "t": 309.58,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "originalT": 311.6,
      "en": "Sure I am. But there's so much more to consider.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 311.32,
      "asrEnd": 314.3,
      "t": 311.589,
      "source": "interpolated-review",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "originalT": 314.6,
      "en": "I talked to Mr. Marchetta.",
      "coverage": 0.8,
      "asrStart": 315.68,
      "asrEnd": 316.96,
      "t": 314.602,
      "source": "interpolated-review",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "originalT": 318.6,
      "en": "What did he say? Did you tell him about me?",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 318.62,
      "asrEnd": 320.28,
      "t": 318.62,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "originalT": 320.6,
      "en": "Of course, Harry. I want what's best for you,",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 320.84,
      "asrEnd": 323.0,
      "t": 320.84,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "originalT": 323.6,
      "en": "and I think I can get a good job",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 323.8,
      "asrEnd": 326.32,
      "t": 323.8,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "originalT": 326.6,
      "en": "through Mr. Marchetta",
      "coverage": 0.667,
      "asrStart": 326.32,
      "asrEnd": 326.7,
      "t": 326.38,
      "source": "interpolated-review",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "originalT": 327.6,
      "en": "in Los Angeles also.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 327.24,
      "asrEnd": 328.22,
      "t": 327.24,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "originalT": 328.6,
      "en": "You're kidding.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 328.6,
      "asrEnd": 329.02,
      "t": 328.32,
      "source": "interpolated-review",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "originalT": 329.6,
      "en": "No, I'm not kidding.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 329.4,
      "asrEnd": 330.28,
      "t": 329.4,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "originalT": 330.6,
      "en": "I talked with him, and he understands completely.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 330.8,
      "asrEnd": 332.66,
      "t": 330.8,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "originalT": 332.6,
      "en": "He has a major toy buyer in Los Angeles,",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 333.38,
      "asrEnd": 335.64,
      "t": 333.38,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "originalT": 335.6,
      "en": "and he's pretty sure that I can get a good job there.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 335.64,
      "asrEnd": 338.16,
      "t": 336.089,
      "source": "interpolated-review",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "originalT": 338.6,
      "en": "Unbelievable!",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 338.94,
      "asrEnd": 339.34,
      "t": 338.797,
      "source": "interpolated-review",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "originalT": 339.6,
      "en": "But I think we should talk to Michelle about all of this.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 339.7,
      "asrEnd": 342.38,
      "t": 339.7,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "originalT": 342.6,
      "en": "You're right. We'll talk to her about it.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 343.3,
      "asrEnd": 345.7,
      "t": 343.3,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "originalT": 346.6,
      "en": "And how do you feel about taking the job in Los Angeles?",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 347.24,
      "asrEnd": 350.24,
      "t": 347.24,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "originalT": 350.6,
      "en": "How should I feel?",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 351.08,
      "asrEnd": 351.82,
      "t": 351.08,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "originalT": 352.6,
      "en": "It's the biggest company in the country.",
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "asrStart": 352.16,
      "asrEnd": 353.42,
      "t": 352.16,
      "source": "matched-anchor",
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "originalT": 353.6,
      "en": "Well, then you feel good about taking it?",
      "coverage": 0.875,
      "asrStart": null,
      "asrEnd": 355.64,
      "t": null,
      "source": "unresolved",
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "originalT": 356.6,
      "en": "Well ... I feel fine about it. Why shouldn't I?",
